  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "kizuna_history_b_01",
      "hash64": "8968E1ACA93B26A7",
      "text": "Tiens, mais voilà [VAR 0x0100(0000)], de la 1-A ![VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "kizuna_history_b_02",
      "hash64": "8968E2ACA93B285A",
      "text": "Tu veux connaître la suite du conte dont j’ai parlé\\nen cours, c’est ça ?[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "kizuna_history_b_03",
      "hash64": "8968E3ACA93B2A0D",
      "text": "Hé hé, je suis contente que ce soit toi qui aies\\nmordu à l’hameçon ![VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kizuna_history_b_04",
      "hash64": "8968DCACA93B1E28",
      "text": "Essaie pas de mentir. Ton envie d’en savoir plus\\nse lit sur ton visage.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_history_b_05",
      "hash64": "8968DDACA93B1FDB",
      "text": "Il y avait donc quatre trésors : l’urne, l’épée,\\nles tablettes et les magatama.\\c\\nMaintenant, je vais t’expliquer pourquoi le\\nchâteau du roi qui les avait acquis a été détruit.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 177,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_history_b_06",
      "hash64": "8968DEACA93B218E",
      "text": "La vérité, c’est que ces trésors étaient...\\ndes Pokémon ![VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_history_b_07",
      "hash64": "8968DFACA93B2341",
      "text": "Considérés comme des objets précieux,\\nces quatre spécimens sont passés de main\\r\\nen main, s’imprégnant peu à peu de l’avidité\\r\\net de la rancune des êtres humains...[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 126,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 167,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_history_b_08",
      "hash64": "8968D8ACA93B175C",
      "text": "Et quand ils entrèrent en contact avec le désir\\ninsatiable du roi, ils se transformèrent en fléaux\\r\\net commencèrent à semer la destruction.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 141,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_history_b_09",
      "hash64": "8968D9ACA93B190F",
      "text": "Afin de protéger son pays, le roi décida de faire\\nappel à de célèbres experts en Pokémon.\\c\\nLa bataille fut féroce, mais ils parvinrent\\nheureusement à vaincre les différents fléaux.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 182,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_history_b_10",
      "hash64": "896BE6ACA93D64FD",
      "text": "Ensuite, les quatre Pokémon furent scellés\\nquelque part à Paldea.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_history_b_11",
      "hash64": "896BE5ACA93D634A",
      "text": "Qu’en penses-tu ? Tu crois que cette histoire\\na été inventée ?[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kizuna_history_b_12",
      "hash64": "896BE4ACA93D6197",
      "text": "Sérieusement, t’y crois pas du tout ?\\nMoi qui pensais que t’avais l’esprit aventurier...[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "kizuna_history_b_13",
      "hash64": "896BE3ACA93D5FE4",
      "text": "Hé hé... T’es perspicace, ça me plaît ![VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "kizuna_history_b_14",
      "hash64": "896BE2ACA93D5E31",
      "text": "J’ai épluché des tonnes de rapports historiques et\\nde journaux personnels mentionnant les désastres.\\c\\nEt figure-toi que je suis tombée sur de nombreux\\nfaits confirmant la véracité du conte ![VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 192,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "kizuna_history_b_15",
      "hash64": "896BE1ACA93D5C7E",
      "text": "Si jamais j’arrive à prouver que cette histoire\\nest vraie, je te tiendrai au courant.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "kizuna_history_b_system_01",
      "hash64": "45E9C613AB1A2EB9",
      "text": "Vous êtes devenu[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e encore plus proche\\nde madame Mora !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
